      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<div class=\"footer-template\">\n  <section class=\"footer-template__cta\" aria-labelledby=\"footer-cta-title\">\n    <h2 id=\"footer-cta-title\">准备好开始了吗？</h2>\n    <p>订阅每周产品更新与实践建议。</p>\n    <form class=\"footer-template__subscribe\">\n      <label for=\"footer-email\">电子邮箱</label>\n      <div><input id=\"footer-email\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\" required><button type=\"submit\">立即订阅</button></div>\n      <p role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n    </form>\n  </section>\n  <footer class=\"footer-template__footer\">\n    <div class=\"footer-template__cols\">\n      <section><h3>✦ Brand</h3><p>让创造更简单。</p></section>\n      <nav aria-label=\"产品\"><h3>产品</h3><a href=\"#features\">功能</a><a href=\"#pricing\">定价</a><a href=\"#changes\">更新日志</a></nav>\n      <nav aria-label=\"公司\"><h3>公司</h3><a href=\"#about\">关于我们</a><a href=\"#jobs\">招聘</a><a href=\"#blog\">博客</a></nav>\n      <nav aria-label=\"资源\"><h3>资源</h3><a href=\"#docs\">文档</a><a href=\"#api\">API</a><a href=\"#help\">帮助中心</a></nav>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"footer-template__copyright\">© 2026 Brand Inc. 保留所有权利。</p>\n  </footer>\n</div>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const form = document.querySelector('.footer-template__subscribe');\n  const status = form.querySelector('[role=\"status\"]');\n  form.addEventListener('submit', event => {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    if (!form.reportValidity()) return;\n    status.textContent = '订阅成功，请留意确认邮件。';\n    form.reset();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n<style>\n.footer-template { box-sizing: border-box; color: #cbd5e1; background: #0b1220; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }\n.footer-template__cta { padding: 64px 20px; color: #ffffff; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #312e81, #6d28d9); text-align: center; }\n.footer-template__cta h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem); }\n.footer-template__cta > p { margin: 12px 0 26px; color: #e0e7ff; }\n.footer-template__subscribe { max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: left; }\n.footer-template__subscribe label { display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 700; }\n.footer-template__subscribe > div { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }\n.footer-template input { box-sizing: border-box; flex: 1 1 240px; min-height: 46px; padding: 12px 14px; border: 0; border-radius: 10px; font: inherit; }\n.footer-template button { min-height: 46px; padding: 12px 22px; border: 0; border-radius: 10px; color: #312e81; background: #ffffff; font: inherit; font-weight: 800; cursor: pointer; }\n.footer-template [role=\"status\"] { min-height: 24px; margin: 8px 0 0; color: #fef3c7; }\n.footer-template__footer { padding: 48px 24px 24px; }\n.footer-template__cols { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 32px; max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; }\n.footer-template h3 { margin: 0 0 12px; color: #ffffff; font-size: 1rem; }\n.footer-template nav a { display: block; min-height: 38px; padding: 7px 0; color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; }\n.footer-template__copyright { max-width: 1120px; margin: 32px auto 0; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #263247; color: #94a3b8; text-align: center; }\n.footer-template input:focus-visible, .footer-template button:focus-visible, .footer-template a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #fde68a; outline-offset: 3px; }\n@media (max-width: 720px) { .footer-template__cols { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }\n</style>\n"
    }
